flowchart TD
    Start([CSP user wants to call the customer about an active ticket]) --> Open[Opens the ticket in the CSP App]
    Open --> Tap[Taps the Call CTA]
    Tap --> Dialer[Phone dialer opens with the Wiom IVR Masked number pre-filled]
    Dialer --> Dial[CSP user taps dial]
    Dial --> Ring[Customer's phone rings - shows the Wiom IVR Masked number, not the CSP's personal mobile]
    Ring --> Pick{Customer picks up?}
    Pick -->|Yes| Connect[Both parties talk. Call ends. Recording saved.]
    Pick -->|No| Audio[CSP hears 'call not picked' message]
    Audio --> Notif[Customer gets a missed-call alert on the Customer App]
    Notif --> Followup[When customer calls back -> flow continues as UC 09 or UC 10]

    classDef start fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#312e81
    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class Start start
    class Connect good
    class Audio,Notif,Followup neutral
